{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜结构图\n窗口、逐点跨帧扫掠和命中输出。[[Combat/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Combat.canvas|运行流程]]\n02a 完整构建及冷启动近战自动化通过，无错误/警告；验证边界见 [[Combat/结构]]。真实动画接入待验收。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1540,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GA / Montage Event\n`BeginTraceWindow(StartSocket, EndSocket, Radius)` → 打开窗口。\n`EndTraceWindow()` → 关闭。\n[[BossAI/结构]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 225,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOMeleeTraceComponent\n`BeginTraceWindow` → 校验 Socket/数值。\n`PerformTrace` → 分段球扫掠并请求 PhysicalMaterial。\n`EndTraceWindow` → 唯一窗口清理。\n`OnMeleeHit(Actor, Hit)` → 命中广播。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "mesh",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## SkeletalMesh Socket / TraceChannel\nStartSocket、EndSocket 定义判定线段；TraceRadius 与碰撞通道决定扫掠体。",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 窗口内状态\nPreviousStart/End：跨帧基线，首帧不命中。\nHitActorsThisWindow：窗口内弱引用去重。\nWindowSerial：回调关闭/重开后旧查询立即退出。\nDeactivate/OnUnregister/EndPlay 均幂等清理。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gas",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AbilitySystem / Physics\nGA 用共享命中载荷生成 GE/Cue；HitResult 携带所请求的物理材质。Trace 不依赖 GAS。[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Physics/结构]]",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 窗口与命中接口契约\nGA/Montage Event → BeginTraceWindow；NotifyEnd/GA 收尾或组件 Deactivate/OnUnregister/EndPlay → EndTraceWindow。\nPerformTrace 用 bReturnPhysicalMaterial 的 SweepMultiByChannel 产 HitResult，并在窗口内去重。\nOnMeleeHit → PlayerCombo/BossMelee → BuildHitEffectPayload / ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget / ExecuteGameplayCue；Trace 只报告命中，不拥有 Context、伤害或表现规则。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "ga",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "trace",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "开/关判定窗口"
    },
    {
